    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92964" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥώψ</span></b>  (B), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
